  Rendering notes:
    - This template is consumed by render_deck.py, which globs
      acceleration/templates/deck/slide_*.html.tmpl in numerical
      order, substitutes the three tokens above from
      metrics.json + inflection.json, and writes the result into the
      <div class="slides"> block of acceleration/executive-presentation.html.
    - The renderer concatenates the file contents verbatim, including
      this leading HTML comment (comments are HTML-valid and inert at
      render time). Retaining the comment in the rendered output
      preserves provenance for downstream maintainers without affecting
      the visual deck.
    - Lucide runtime: the parent HTML shell initializes Lucide 0.460.0
      and calls lucide.createIcons() on Reveal "ready" and "slidechanged"
      events, replacing each <i data-lucide="name"> tag with its
      corresponding <svg data-lucide="name"> element. theme.css §Phase
      11 selectors target both forms.
    - The slide RELIES on CSS classes from theme.css: .title-slide,
      .eyebrow, .title-meta. No inline style="…" attributes are used
      in this template — styling concerns stay in theme.css per the
      file-creation spec (Phase 5).
    - Tokens are LITERAL strings using a double-brace UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
      syntax (the four tokens enumerated in the Required tokens section
      above are the only renderer-owned identifiers on this slide). They
      are NOT wrapped in any other markers (no <% %>, no ${ }, no
      jinja2 {% %}) — the renderer performs simple string replacement.

